CONTACT_EXTRA = [
    "<strong>What this page is for.</strong> CalculatesAll is a free collection of browser-based tools, including calculators for Zakat, BMI, EMI, compound interest, profit and loss, discounts, percentages, fractions, dates and age, a unit converter, a standard calculator, a tasbih counter and a stopwatch. This page is the one place to reach the site about any of them: a result that looks wrong, an explanation that is hard to follow, a button that does not respond, a layout problem on your screen, or a suggestion for a new tool.",
    "<strong>What to include in a calculation-error report.</strong> A report is easiest to check when we can repeat exactly what you did. Please send the page address or tool name; every value you entered, written exactly as you typed it and with its unit; any option you chose, such as kilograms or pounds on the BMI calculator; the result the page showed; and the result you expected, with a short note on how you worked it out or the source you compared it with. If the problem is with the page rather than the arithmetic, tell us the browser and type of device you used and what happened when you tapped or clicked. A screenshot helps but is not required.",
    "<strong>Use example numbers where you can.</strong> The calculators run in your browser, so the values you type are not sent to us. They only reach us if you put them in an email. If a problem appears while you are using your real salary, savings or health measurements, try to reproduce it with rounded example numbers first and send those instead.",
    "<strong>Translations and accessibility.</strong> Most tools also have an Urdu version. If an Urdu label or explanation is wrong or unclear, quote the exact text and the page it appears on. Problems with screen readers, keyboard navigation, colour contrast or text size can be reported in the same way.",
    "<strong>Privacy questions.</strong> Questions about cookies, advertising, local browser storage or personal information are answered in the <a class='underline text-sky-800 dark:text-sky-300' href='/privacy/'>Privacy Policy</a>, which also describes the choices available to you. If it does not cover your question, you can write to the same address. We do not sell personal information, and your email is used only to deal with the message you send.",
    "<strong>What this address cannot help with.</strong> We cannot give personal financial, medical, legal or religious advice, or confirm a decision for you. The tools show a method and a result; for decisions that depend on your own circumstances, please speak to a qualified professional.",
]

